WEBVTT

00:06.666 --> 00:10.750
[tense rock music playing]

00:14.625 --> 00:16.958
Go on. Come at me.

00:17.041 --> 00:18.708
You piece of shit.

00:19.416 --> 00:22.416
Bastard. You really wanna die, do you?

00:23.333 --> 00:25.791
[Shimura] I can tell
he's overcome with rage.

00:27.125 --> 00:28.625
This is…

00:29.291 --> 00:30.416
[gasps]

00:36.208 --> 00:37.208
[clicks]

00:37.291 --> 00:41.291
[TOU-KEI] Rule number one.
Don't lose your cool.

00:42.541 --> 00:46.291
It's easy to defeat
someone who's lost their cool.

00:47.166 --> 00:49.833
If you can't keep yourself under control,

00:49.916 --> 00:54.875
then you're using your emotions,
not your fists.

00:55.375 --> 00:59.666
In other words, if you can get
your opponent to lose his cool,

01:00.166 --> 01:03.208
then you gain you a significant advantage.

01:08.416 --> 01:10.333
-[Hamaken grunts]
-[students gasp]

01:11.208 --> 01:12.250
[Shimura] I dodged.

01:12.958 --> 01:16.750
Just maybe…
that chicken guy is the real deal.

01:16.833 --> 01:18.708
Can his videos actually make me stronger?

01:18.791 --> 01:20.416
Quit dodging! Agh!

01:20.500 --> 01:23.958
[Shimura] Here it comes again.
If I'm gonna get hit, I might as well try…

01:24.041 --> 01:26.166
[TOU-KEI] A punch is at its most powerful

01:26.250 --> 01:28.541
when the arm is fully extended.

01:28.625 --> 01:32.708
So if you can take the hit before
your opponent fully extends his arm,

01:34.166 --> 01:36.166
it won't hurt so much.

01:36.250 --> 01:40.166
We'll call it
the "how to get hit without pain" method.

01:40.250 --> 01:41.833
[Shimura] He's right.

01:41.916 --> 01:44.083
It doesn't… hurt!

01:44.166 --> 01:47.541
-What the hell is he doing?
-[tense electronic music playing]

01:47.625 --> 01:49.375
[Shimura] That chicken guy was right.

01:50.333 --> 01:51.583
Just who the hell is he?

01:52.083 --> 01:53.125
[Hamaken roars]

01:53.625 --> 01:56.375
[music intensifies]

01:56.458 --> 01:58.666
[Shimura] I can do this. I can win!

01:59.166 --> 02:02.000
[panting]

02:04.208 --> 02:05.125
[Shimura] Wait!

02:05.208 --> 02:07.208
-[music stops]
-What comes after this?

02:08.625 --> 02:09.875
Hold on.

02:09.958 --> 02:12.375
-What am I supposed to do next?
-[tense music playing]

02:12.458 --> 02:13.791
[light switch clicks]

02:13.875 --> 02:16.000
[Shimura] Wait! I need you to tell me--

02:16.083 --> 02:17.000
[Hamaken roars]

02:17.458 --> 02:19.416
[gagging, straining]

02:19.500 --> 02:20.333
Shimura…

02:24.041 --> 02:26.250
You've got some nerve, haven't you?

02:26.333 --> 02:27.208
Oh shit.

02:27.291 --> 02:28.125
[squeaks]

02:28.625 --> 02:30.583
I should've watched the next video too.

02:31.083 --> 02:32.250
[groaning]

02:32.333 --> 02:34.833
-[Hamaken] You're fucking dead--
-[girl] Stop right there!

02:34.916 --> 02:38.125
[music fades]

02:38.208 --> 02:40.125
I'm streaming the both of you.

02:41.791 --> 02:44.375
So, are you going to continue doing this?

02:49.750 --> 02:50.958
[Hamaken] You bastards.

02:51.833 --> 02:53.333
You'll pay for this.

03:07.458 --> 03:09.375
How long has it been rolling for?

03:11.041 --> 03:12.041
It never went live.

03:12.125 --> 03:14.000
-What?!
-I was bluffing.

03:20.541 --> 03:23.250
Thank you for saving me.

03:24.875 --> 03:26.666
-Don't mention it.
-Your name is?

03:28.250 --> 03:30.083
Yashio Aki. I'm a first-year.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.125
Oh. Younger than us.

03:32.208 --> 03:34.833
I lived abroad for quite some time.

03:35.541 --> 03:37.708
So, I'm kind of new around here.

03:38.208 --> 03:39.666
I see. That's nice.

03:39.750 --> 03:41.875
You should just thank her
for saving your ass.

03:43.291 --> 03:44.750
So, you're Aki.

03:44.833 --> 03:46.125
That's a nice name.

03:47.125 --> 03:50.291
Agh! You know,
if you'd only held out for longer,

03:50.375 --> 03:52.833
the donations were starting to come in.

03:53.458 --> 03:55.708
How much money did we make?

03:57.750 --> 03:59.166
25,000.

04:00.500 --> 04:01.750
Oh, that's all?

04:02.750 --> 04:07.791
Well, you would've wasted your time
trying to hang out any longer.

04:08.666 --> 04:10.958
I think that could've been the end of you.

04:11.625 --> 04:12.791
Yes. You're right, there.

04:12.875 --> 04:14.541
So, I'm curious.

04:14.625 --> 04:17.333
Who edits the videos
after the streaming's over?

04:17.791 --> 04:19.625
Uh… I do.

04:21.000 --> 04:23.000
-Oh, you like my editing?
-It's mediocre.

04:23.083 --> 04:24.208
Oh.

04:24.291 --> 04:26.541
You'll never get more viewers like this.

04:26.625 --> 04:30.000
And the fewer the viewers,
then the fewer the donations.

04:30.583 --> 04:33.625
But… what can we do about that?

04:34.333 --> 04:35.166
[Aki] Hmm.

04:36.208 --> 04:37.875
I'm pretty good at editing, you know?

04:38.750 --> 04:39.625
-Oh?
-Huh?

04:39.708 --> 04:41.750
[Toru laughs]

04:44.500 --> 04:46.333
Why don't you let me assist you?

04:47.541 --> 04:49.625
[upbeat electronic music playing]

04:50.916 --> 04:51.875
-Hey.
-Yeah?

04:51.958 --> 04:54.125
-Is this girl really gonna be our editor?
-Why not?

04:54.208 --> 04:56.625
-We could use a female perspective.
-Leave it to me.

04:56.708 --> 04:58.250
I'll get you more subscribers.

04:58.333 --> 05:01.375
You see? She's going to get us
a lot more subscribers!

05:01.458 --> 05:04.250
And we need a name. What though?

05:04.333 --> 05:06.708
True. Right now it's
still "Kanegon TV" now.

05:06.791 --> 05:09.000
Maybe Aki can come up with a new name.

05:09.083 --> 05:11.625
Girls are good
at that sort of thing, aren't you?

05:11.708 --> 05:13.750
I've already thought of one.

05:13.833 --> 05:15.250
Hey, for real?

05:17.666 --> 05:20.041
What about "Viral Hit"?

05:20.625 --> 05:23.541
-What?
-"Viral Hit"?

05:23.625 --> 05:24.750
[jaunty music playing]

05:24.833 --> 05:26.958
HOW_TO_FIGHT

05:27.041 --> 05:28.708
Aki, that's a little--

05:28.791 --> 05:30.458
You don't like it, I'll quit then.

05:31.541 --> 05:32.791
Wait a second.

05:32.875 --> 05:36.083
Actually, it's quite original.
Oh, it's good!

05:36.166 --> 05:37.333
You like it too?

05:37.416 --> 05:39.875
-Yeah.
-It's decided then.

05:39.958 --> 05:43.875
Today's we become known as Viral Hit!

05:43.958 --> 05:45.791
You're gonna be so busy! Huh? Huh?

05:45.875 --> 05:48.208
You won't have time to fry potatoes!

05:48.291 --> 05:50.333
-Sure.
-[Aki chuckles]

05:54.083 --> 05:55.166
AMERICAN HOUSE DINER

05:55.250 --> 05:56.625
[TOU-KEI] Let's enjoy!

05:56.708 --> 06:01.000
One, two, three, four,
five, and six, seven, eight.

06:01.083 --> 06:04.583
One, two, three, four, five, six.
Raise your legs high!

06:04.666 --> 06:08.750
Tighten your abs. Now exhale. One…

06:08.833 --> 06:10.166
I'm beat.

06:10.250 --> 06:12.375
[panting]

06:14.375 --> 06:17.291
Will I really get stronger doing this?

06:17.875 --> 06:19.333
[continues panting]

06:20.333 --> 06:23.708
Who was it that sent me this video
in the first place?

06:25.000 --> 06:26.916
Hey, Shimura, your break's almost over.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.000
-Asamiya-san.
-[TOU-KEI] One, two, three…

06:29.083 --> 06:31.541
-Okay then. Thank you.
-Four, five, six, seven, eight!

06:31.625 --> 06:34.583
-One, two, three, four, five, six, seven…
-Hey, I can hear something.

06:34.666 --> 06:36.416
-What?
-Moving on to heel jacks now!

06:36.500 --> 06:39.333
-One, two, three…
-Oh. Probably just your imagination.

06:39.416 --> 06:41.458
-Ah. Okay.
-One, two…

06:41.541 --> 06:44.083
The manager wants to talk to you
about your schedule.

06:44.166 --> 06:47.000
Oh. I had a hunch he would. Thank you.

06:47.500 --> 06:49.291
[breathing heavily]

06:54.125 --> 06:56.375
[Karakida] I can't just take you
out of the schedule.

06:56.458 --> 06:58.958
If you don't give me any notice,
it's gonna be hard.

06:59.041 --> 07:01.125
So sorry. I know this is late notice.

07:01.208 --> 07:03.666
Shimura, you're here
almost every single day.

07:03.750 --> 07:04.791
Yeah…

07:06.791 --> 07:10.000
[Karakida groans] How about this?
Jessica could cover Ryan.

07:10.083 --> 07:13.666
-Or… ugh, I don't know--
-[Kaho] I have an idea.

07:13.750 --> 07:18.541
What if the rest of us took turns
on the days Shimura can't come in yet?

07:18.625 --> 07:19.458
Huh.

07:19.541 --> 07:22.333
We could set up a group chat
for the part-timers.

07:23.375 --> 07:25.583
[man] Yeah, sounds like a good idea.
Let's do it.

07:25.666 --> 07:27.083
-[Kaho] Okay.
-[man] Works for me.

07:27.166 --> 07:28.125
[woman] Sure, go ahead.

07:28.208 --> 07:29.041
KAHO ASAMIYA

07:29.125 --> 07:31.750
[Toru] You just exchanged line accounts,
that's all.

07:31.833 --> 07:33.000
You can say what you want.

07:33.083 --> 07:38.208
But this phone is now a bridge
and it connects us together! [squeals]

07:39.291 --> 07:40.916
[Kaho] Thanks for connecting with me.

07:41.000 --> 07:44.083
Even her sticker… it's gorgeous!

07:44.166 --> 07:45.291
Oh!

07:45.375 --> 07:48.375
Hey! Wait! You're that famous streamer!

07:48.458 --> 07:51.416
-Oh, do you know me?
-Well, of course I do!

07:51.500 --> 07:53.916
-Whoa! It's really you!
-Hey, I'm his producer, you know.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.291
Who are these guys anyway?

07:56.375 --> 07:57.875
Celebrities!

07:57.958 --> 07:59.833
[screaming]

07:59.916 --> 08:01.625
-[both laughing]
-[woman] Hey, hey, hey!

08:01.708 --> 08:04.458
-This is our lucky day!
-Why don't we go talk over there?

08:04.541 --> 08:06.291
-Yeah, okay. Okay.
-[woman squealing]

08:06.375 --> 08:07.791
-Let's go!
-Can I shake your hand?

08:07.875 --> 08:08.708
Sure. Of course.

08:08.791 --> 08:10.375
-Whoa!
-Yeah, go ahead.

08:10.458 --> 08:12.666
-You're so good-looking.
-You're so much cooler in person!

08:13.583 --> 08:15.333
And… jump.

08:15.416 --> 08:19.458
-Jump, jump, jump, jump! [giggles]
-[coins jangling]

08:19.541 --> 08:22.083
Hey! You're still hiding money in there!

08:22.666 --> 08:24.833
[Shimura] I suspected
it would lead to this.

08:24.916 --> 08:26.250
[man] It's a big light on.

08:26.333 --> 08:29.791
Hey! These guys don't have
much cash at all.

08:29.875 --> 08:32.333
What?! I thought you guys were loaded.

08:32.416 --> 08:34.166
No. This is so lame.

08:34.833 --> 08:35.708
Hey.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.875
This here is mine now.

08:37.958 --> 08:39.916
No! That's my bridge to Asamiya!

08:40.000 --> 08:41.291
-Shut the hell up!
-[groaning]

08:41.375 --> 08:43.750
Touch me again, kid,
and you are going down.

08:43.833 --> 08:47.333
-Ken, you're so brutal! I just love you.
-You think so?

08:47.416 --> 08:48.875
-[Shimura] Hey! Wait!
-I love you too.

08:48.958 --> 08:51.333
-[woman] I'm starving. Can we eat now?
-[Ken] Yeah, let's go.

08:51.416 --> 08:54.791
Kanegon, we've got to notify the police
and get my phone back!

08:54.875 --> 08:56.666
Huh? Notify the police?

08:56.750 --> 08:58.041
Are you kidding?!

08:58.625 --> 08:59.583
Huh?

08:59.666 --> 09:02.291
Look! All the fans going wild.

09:02.375 --> 09:03.916
[Shimura] Were you streaming?

09:04.000 --> 09:06.125
Yeah, of course I was.

09:08.125 --> 09:09.458
Can't you hear it?

09:09.541 --> 09:12.000
I can hear the jingle
of cash hitting our account.

09:13.791 --> 09:16.416
That means
I get beaten up again, doesn't it?

09:17.000 --> 09:18.500
So you want out?

09:19.708 --> 09:22.791
Fine. I get it.
We'll go talk to the police.

09:22.875 --> 09:24.125
[Shimura] The police.

09:29.208 --> 09:31.000
No way.  We can't.

09:35.583 --> 09:39.125
Viral Hit's live stream is starting now!

09:39.208 --> 09:40.958
PROB GONNA MAKE A DONATION

09:41.041 --> 09:42.833
I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS!

09:42.916 --> 09:44.583
THIS IS GONNA BE EPIC!

09:44.666 --> 09:46.166
I'M DONATING, TOO!

09:46.250 --> 09:48.250
[suspenseful music playing]

09:53.333 --> 09:58.833
VIRAL HIT

09:58.916 --> 10:01.000
-[Ken] What? You want your phone back?
-[music fades]

10:01.083 --> 10:02.791
That's right. Please give it back.

10:02.875 --> 10:05.291
[woman] Ken, they're
here filming us now, you know?

10:05.375 --> 10:08.041
Oh, yeah? Now I'll be famous, right?

10:08.125 --> 10:09.166
-Yeah!
-Hey.

10:09.250 --> 10:11.083
I really think
you should stop filming me, okay?

10:11.166 --> 10:12.583
[Toru] Don't worry, I will.

10:13.083 --> 10:15.166
Hey! What did you want from me?

10:15.250 --> 10:18.250
Like I said, I want my phone back.

10:18.333 --> 10:19.666
What if I say no?

10:20.500 --> 10:21.833
If you refuse,

10:22.458 --> 10:24.083
you leave me no choice.

10:24.166 --> 10:26.791
[both laughing]

10:26.875 --> 10:28.000
Are you for real, now?

10:28.083 --> 10:30.666
God damn, kid. Just smack him, Ken.

10:30.750 --> 10:33.041
-Well, let's see, huh?
-[woman squealing]

10:33.125 --> 10:35.000
Everybody watching, check me out now,

10:35.083 --> 10:37.666
and make him know for sure
that I is the man!

10:37.750 --> 10:39.541
-[woman] Whoo! Go, Ken!
-[crowd cheering]

10:39.625 --> 10:43.125
[Shimura] This is my chance
to try out what I've learned.

10:43.208 --> 10:47.250
[TOU-KEI] First, identify your opponent's
dominant hand.

10:47.333 --> 10:49.500
If your opponent is an amateur fighter,

10:49.583 --> 10:53.041
there's a high chancel they'll use
their dominant hand to strike.

10:53.125 --> 10:54.708
His dominant hand is…

10:54.791 --> 10:57.041
-No! That's my bridge to Asamiya!
-Shut the hell up!

10:57.125 --> 10:58.750
[Shimura] He's right-handed.

10:58.833 --> 11:00.875
[TOU-KEI] If your opponent is
right-handed,

11:00.958 --> 11:02.958
then stand on their left side

11:03.041 --> 11:05.541
so they're likely to swing
using their right hand.

11:06.500 --> 11:09.750
You see, now you force them
to swing at you using their right hand.

11:09.833 --> 11:11.416
You're looking scared! Ready to have fun?

11:11.500 --> 11:14.416
[TOU-KEI] Not sure
when to dodge the punch?

11:14.500 --> 11:15.875
It's simple.

11:15.958 --> 11:18.666
People who lack training in martial arts 

11:18.750 --> 11:22.583
tend to move their shoulders very wide
when they swing at you.

11:22.666 --> 11:24.583
[Ken roars]

11:25.625 --> 11:26.583
[TOU-KEI] Now!

11:26.666 --> 11:27.833
-[crowd gasping]
-[Ken grunts]

11:27.916 --> 11:29.875
-[rock music playing]
-You little rat!

11:29.958 --> 11:31.875
[woman] Come on, Ken! Get him!

11:31.958 --> 11:33.291
-[Ken grunts]
-[clattering]

11:33.375 --> 11:34.666
You bastard!

11:36.750 --> 11:38.041
[Ken grunts]

11:38.125 --> 11:39.125
HE'S DANCING LOL

11:39.208 --> 11:40.500
CHICKEN DANCE LOL

11:41.708 --> 11:43.500
[Ken] What's that weird-ass move?

11:44.166 --> 11:45.833
[Aki] Weaving. That's basic technique.

11:45.916 --> 11:47.916
LET'S GO SHIMURA! LMAO

11:49.375 --> 11:51.458
[TOU-KEI] Well done! You're doing well.

11:51.541 --> 11:52.916
God damn it! Stop moving!

11:53.000 --> 11:55.041
-[woman] Go, Ken! Go! Get him!
-[Ken grunting]

11:55.125 --> 11:58.208
You'll find it's very hard
for the average person

11:58.291 --> 12:00.166
to land a punch on a moving target.

12:01.416 --> 12:03.750
-[crowd clamoring]
-[Shimura] That one worked too.

12:03.833 --> 12:04.791
Aerobics?

12:04.875 --> 12:07.583
[TOU-KEI] Aerobics will teach you
how to move your body.

12:08.125 --> 12:10.500
And you will learn about rhythm too.

12:10.583 --> 12:12.125
-[woman] Yes, Ken!
-[Ken] Stop moving!

12:12.208 --> 12:13.291
Wait! Wait! Wait!

12:13.375 --> 12:14.291
[screaming]

12:14.375 --> 12:17.333
[fighters grunting]

12:18.291 --> 12:20.500
[Ken] Come back here, you little shit!

12:22.041 --> 12:23.958
[Ken snarling]

12:24.041 --> 12:25.583
[grunting]

12:25.666 --> 12:26.625
Get outta my way!

12:26.708 --> 12:27.583
[grunts]

12:29.375 --> 12:31.666
[Shimura] It… didn't hurt.

12:33.708 --> 12:36.875
[TOU-KEI] Fighting isn't
so intimidating anymore, is it?

12:37.583 --> 12:40.375
So now, let's enjoy!

12:40.458 --> 12:43.250
-Now, Ken!
-Now say good night, kid! [grunts]

12:43.333 --> 12:47.458
-[grunting]
-[woman screaming]

12:52.041 --> 12:53.875
[Shimura panting]

12:53.958 --> 12:56.375
-[Ken continues grunting]
-[woman screaming]

12:56.458 --> 12:57.333
Wait, what?

12:57.416 --> 12:59.958
[Toru] Move! Move!
Let me through! Move! Move!

13:00.041 --> 13:02.833
-Ken, what's happening?
-And now you're gonna die!

13:02.916 --> 13:05.416
[Shimura] Oh crap! I can't move an inch!

13:05.500 --> 13:07.416
Dumbass!

13:07.500 --> 13:09.791
[Shimura] "How to get hit without pain"!

13:09.875 --> 13:10.875
[Ken grunts]

13:12.458 --> 13:13.458
-Huh?
-[woman] Ken?

13:13.541 --> 13:14.958
[music subsides]

13:15.041 --> 13:18.458
Give me back… my phone.

13:18.541 --> 13:21.125
[snarling]

13:21.208 --> 13:22.750
[suspenseful music playing]

13:22.833 --> 13:24.125
I WANNA LEARN THIS

13:24.208 --> 13:25.750
REVENGE OF THE UNDERDOG!

13:26.333 --> 13:27.333
[Ken grunts]

13:28.125 --> 13:30.166
-[crowd clamoring]
-[bottle shatters]

13:30.250 --> 13:32.000
-[glass shattering]
-[Ken straining]

13:32.083 --> 13:33.916
[Ken grunting, yelling]

13:34.000 --> 13:35.416
[woman] You got it, Ken!

13:35.500 --> 13:37.791
DO YOU HAVE A PLATE IN YOUR FOREHEAD?

13:37.875 --> 13:39.291
[grunting]

13:39.375 --> 13:40.750
HE'S TAKING ALL THE HITS

13:40.833 --> 13:42.333
CAN'T BEAT A REAL THUG

13:45.208 --> 13:47.833
[Aki] Not so sure about that.
Look at that thug's fist.

13:47.916 --> 13:49.083
[crowd clamoring] Hey!

13:49.166 --> 13:51.708
-[Ken groans] Oh!
-[woman] What? Huh? Huh? Oh!

13:51.791 --> 13:53.875
-[Ken yells in pain]
-[woman] Ken, are you okay?

13:53.958 --> 13:55.541
Yeah, yeah. I'm good.

13:55.625 --> 13:57.708
-[Ken] This sucks!
-[woman] Ken, you poor thing!

13:57.791 --> 14:00.208
[Aki] He doesn't realize it
because of the adrenaline,

14:00.291 --> 14:01.833
but his fist is all banged up.

14:01.916 --> 14:02.833
[woman whimpering]

14:02.916 --> 14:04.708
Shit! [snarling]

14:04.791 --> 14:06.750
Okay. Take it then!

14:06.833 --> 14:08.125
[crowd] Whoa!

14:08.208 --> 14:09.083
[man laughs]

14:09.166 --> 14:12.041
Fine. You're all gonna see me again.

14:12.125 --> 14:13.708
-Come on!
-Assholes!

14:13.791 --> 14:14.833
[crowd cheering]

14:14.916 --> 14:16.333
Asamiya!

14:16.416 --> 14:18.458
You did it, Shimura!

14:18.541 --> 14:21.125
Now, a word
for all the viewers who donated.

14:21.708 --> 14:23.750
Don't miss our next performance, okay?

14:23.833 --> 14:26.125
That's all from Viral Hit.

14:26.208 --> 14:30.000
Oh, I forgot to say, please keep
the donations coming! [laughs]

14:30.541 --> 14:33.166
[Toru] Hey, are you in pain?
You got beaten up there.

14:33.250 --> 14:34.541
Oh, no.

14:34.625 --> 14:36.833
Uh, uh, well, a little. Yeah.

14:36.916 --> 14:38.041
SO IT DOES HURT LOL

14:38.125 --> 14:40.208
SHIMURA, HERO OF BULLIED KIDS!

14:40.291 --> 14:41.958
49,917 VIEWERS WATCHING NOW

14:43.250 --> 14:46.583
-[Toru] Hey, don't forget to subscribe!
-[Shimura] And, uh, please donate!

14:46.666 --> 14:48.333
[Toru] Yeah, keep the donations coming!

14:48.416 --> 14:49.583
[girl] You were so great!

14:49.666 --> 14:50.875
[Toru] Thank you!

14:52.083 --> 14:53.416
-You're so cute.
- Thank you.

14:53.500 --> 14:55.833
-Hi!
-[Shimura] Uh, oh, okay.

14:55.916 --> 14:59.166
[Shimura] Please subscribe to our channel,
um, and make donations.

15:03.708 --> 15:04.708
[music fades]

15:08.583 --> 15:10.750
[fast-forward clicking]

15:15.208 --> 15:19.083
[Shimura] Currently, we have five videos
on our Viral Hit channel.

15:19.166 --> 15:22.500
And we've reached
more than five million views in total.

15:22.583 --> 15:23.416
And…

15:23.500 --> 15:25.166
[jaunty music playing]

15:25.250 --> 15:28.041
-[Toru] All right! We did it!
-Yay!

15:28.125 --> 15:30.875
[Shimura] Now we have our first payout.

15:30.958 --> 15:32.583
This is more than my job pays.

15:33.166 --> 15:35.958
[Toru] Well, we're in the money now,
aren't we, huh?!

15:37.625 --> 15:39.833
How should we divide it?

15:40.458 --> 15:42.291
-I'm okay. I don't care.
-You sure?

15:42.375 --> 15:43.750
It's not okay.

15:43.833 --> 15:46.166
You don't need
to be so considerate like that.

15:46.750 --> 15:49.000
I know, but this is
mainly just a hobby for me.

15:49.083 --> 15:50.833
Then I'll gladly accept your kindness.

15:50.916 --> 15:52.125
No, you won't.

15:52.208 --> 15:56.041
I will… look after your share
until we decide.

15:56.125 --> 15:57.375
Yeah. Whatever.

15:57.458 --> 15:59.833
Let's split it like this.

15:59.916 --> 16:04.083
Until now, I've done all the filming,
content, editing and directing.

16:04.958 --> 16:06.041
That's worth 90.

16:07.041 --> 16:08.208
And you get ten.

16:08.291 --> 16:09.166
What?

16:10.375 --> 16:12.833
Okay, then. Let's shake on it.

16:19.791 --> 16:20.875
[music stops]

16:20.958 --> 16:22.208
-Get real.
-Huh?

16:22.291 --> 16:25.666
Why is it 90/10?
I earn more than that making french fries.

16:25.750 --> 16:27.458
Oh, oh, okay then.

16:27.541 --> 16:28.958
How about…

16:29.041 --> 16:31.416
I take 60 and you take 40?

16:32.291 --> 16:34.833
You go get beaten up. See how you like it.

16:35.333 --> 16:36.791
Hey, hold on!

16:36.875 --> 16:38.083
Okay, you get 60.

16:38.791 --> 16:40.000
Seventy, then!

16:40.625 --> 16:42.083
Oh, what the hell?

16:42.166 --> 16:43.500
Eighty percent?

16:44.958 --> 16:46.833
All right, 90?

16:51.000 --> 16:53.291
Shall we start our next strategy session?

16:54.083 --> 16:56.416
I like to… please.

16:56.500 --> 17:00.291
[Shimura laughing]

17:00.375 --> 17:02.500
-[Shimura squeals, laughs]
-[Toru] Get off!

17:04.916 --> 17:08.750
-[camera clicking]
-[pop music playing over speakers]

17:11.916 --> 17:12.750
TOO PRETTY!

17:12.833 --> 17:13.916
SHE'S EYE CANDY

17:14.000 --> 17:15.166
YUM YUM!

17:16.791 --> 17:18.375
[girls chatting]

17:18.458 --> 17:19.916
IT'S HAMAKEN'S GIRL LOL

17:20.000 --> 17:21.750
GOOD TIME FOR 10,000 YEN?

17:21.833 --> 17:23.541
SUCH A PICK-ME GIRL

17:23.625 --> 17:25.750
FOLLOWERS: 21,000

17:25.833 --> 17:26.750
[tuts]

17:26.833 --> 17:28.833
[somber music playing]

17:32.500 --> 17:34.625
VIRAL HIT
SUBSCRIBERS: 102,000

17:37.166 --> 17:38.041
[sighs]

17:38.541 --> 17:40.041
[Hamaken growls]

17:41.083 --> 17:44.208
[growling]

17:48.000 --> 17:49.833
[growling intensifies]/

17:51.125 --> 17:52.708
[music fades]

17:53.541 --> 17:54.750
[inhales sharply]

18:12.541 --> 18:15.291
Here's your change of clothes here.
I'll leave them here.

18:16.166 --> 18:17.916
Something good happened today?

18:18.416 --> 18:19.750
Why do you ask?

18:20.333 --> 18:22.666
You seem to be a happy fellow.

18:22.750 --> 18:24.625
No. Nothing in particular.

18:25.708 --> 18:30.125
I forgot. Is there
anything at all that you would like?

18:30.750 --> 18:32.791
Oh! Goodness. What do you mean?

18:33.291 --> 18:34.375
Mm.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.625
There's nothing I want.

18:37.875 --> 18:40.625
Spend your money
only on something for yourself.

18:41.625 --> 18:43.666
It's your hard-earned money.

18:47.125 --> 18:49.375
[woman 1] Here. I bought you this new top.

18:49.458 --> 18:51.583
Oh, is this for me?

18:51.666 --> 18:54.000
-How pretty. [chuckles]
-[woman 2] You think so?

18:54.083 --> 18:55.958
-Oh. Thank you.
-[woman 1] Perfect.

18:56.041 --> 18:57.041
[woman 2 chuckles]

18:57.125 --> 18:58.500
-[laughs]
-[woman 1] I love it.

18:58.583 --> 19:00.083
-Looks great on you.
-[woman 2] Really?

19:00.166 --> 19:01.416
-Yes!
-[woman 2] Thank you.

19:01.500 --> 19:03.541
[birds twittering]

19:03.625 --> 19:05.625
[Shimura inhales]

19:06.166 --> 19:07.875
Mm.

19:10.041 --> 19:10.875
CASHMERE

19:10.958 --> 19:12.208
Ah! It costs a fortune!

19:12.291 --> 19:14.708
-Why's it so expensive?
-[train alert blaring]

19:14.791 --> 19:15.833
[phone chimes]

19:17.750 --> 19:19.541
[approaching train clacking]

19:19.625 --> 19:21.000
That's ridiculous.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.083
[alert stops blaring]

19:28.041 --> 19:32.000
Okay, get your act together.
How am I gonna do this?

19:32.500 --> 19:33.916
[Kaho] Shimura!

19:34.000 --> 19:35.291
[exhales]

19:35.375 --> 19:36.416
[whimsical music playing]

19:36.500 --> 19:39.041
[Shimura] Here comes True Beauty.

19:41.708 --> 19:43.625
Oh. Hi there.

19:43.708 --> 19:46.500
Sorry for the late notice.
Have you been waiting long?

19:46.583 --> 19:47.708
Not at all.

19:48.333 --> 19:49.958
What's wrong? Are you feeling sick?

19:50.041 --> 19:51.250
No. No, I…

19:51.750 --> 19:53.250
On the contrary, I feel great.

19:53.333 --> 19:54.416
[giggles]

19:54.500 --> 19:55.833
That's good. Okay.

19:55.916 --> 19:56.750
Mm.

19:57.541 --> 19:58.875
Am I dreaming?

19:59.375 --> 20:00.958
It's just the two of us.

20:03.625 --> 20:04.750
[Kaho laughs]

20:05.958 --> 20:07.750
Please let me know
when you're ready to order.

20:07.833 --> 20:09.166
[Kaho] Thank you very much.

20:09.666 --> 20:11.375
[sighs]
-[pop music playing over speakers]

20:11.458 --> 20:13.625
I've been wanting to come here. It's nice.

20:13.708 --> 20:14.708
Yes, it is.

20:15.208 --> 20:17.083
I like the café scene a lot too.

20:17.166 --> 20:18.500
Oh, you do?

20:19.000 --> 20:20.583
Oh, I'm so glad.

20:21.375 --> 20:23.625
Thank you for… the other day.

20:24.125 --> 20:28.000
This is my first part-time job,
so I was a bit lost.

20:28.083 --> 20:30.833
And I was very happy
when you intervened.

20:31.333 --> 20:32.416
So, I thank you.

20:32.500 --> 20:33.333
Oh. [chuckles]

20:33.416 --> 20:35.166
You really don't have to.

20:36.208 --> 20:39.875
They got carried away.
Next time, I'll… tell them off.

20:39.958 --> 20:41.041
[laughs]

20:41.125 --> 20:42.791
-Oh, shall we order?
-Mm.

20:43.916 --> 20:45.375
Let's see. Mm.

20:46.083 --> 20:49.750
What the hell?
800 yen for a cup of coffee?

20:50.416 --> 20:52.208
I think I'll have the strawberry parfait.

20:52.291 --> 20:55.500
[Shimura] 1,800 yen?
It's just strawberries and ice cream!

20:55.583 --> 20:59.125
Why does it cost so much?
That's my food budget for a whole week.

20:59.708 --> 21:01.375
Uh, excuse me. Can we order?

21:01.458 --> 21:03.041
-[sever] Oh, sure.
-Thanks.

21:03.125 --> 21:05.791
-Uh, I'll have coffee.
-[server] One coffee.

21:05.875 --> 21:08.125
[Shimura] One coffee costs
what I eat in three days.

21:08.208 --> 21:11.333
-[server] One strawberry parfait.
-Okay. This is a good spot here.

21:11.833 --> 21:13.750
[Aki] We're invading his privacy.

21:13.833 --> 21:17.375
[Toru] Nonsense. If we just stream fights,
viewers will get bored.

21:18.375 --> 21:20.958
Viral Hit, starting live stream now.

21:21.041 --> 21:22.708
[pop music continues]

21:22.791 --> 21:24.166
SHIMURA'S ON A DATE LOL

21:24.250 --> 21:25.791
YOU GOT THIS, WALLFLOWER!

21:40.291 --> 21:41.958
[Kaho] Digging in.

21:44.875 --> 21:49.416
Uh, so, what made you want to work
at that burger joint?

21:49.500 --> 21:50.958
Huh? What do you mean?

21:51.041 --> 21:54.750
I, uh, mean that,
you look like your family's well-to-do.

21:54.833 --> 21:58.583
[gasps] Uh, no. Not at all.
Really. We're just… normal.

21:58.666 --> 22:00.208
Ah, I see.

22:01.166 --> 22:04.041
[Shimura] Oh no.
This is an awkward silence.

22:05.208 --> 22:08.166
-Why is a hottie like her--
-She could be scamming him.

22:08.250 --> 22:09.541
Gotta be.

22:09.625 --> 22:10.625
[men laughing]

22:10.708 --> 22:12.541
[man 1] Must be, surely.

22:12.625 --> 22:15.208
Doesn't this feel like
we're on a double date?

22:15.958 --> 22:18.166
-Want a bite of this?
-I don't like chicken.

22:18.250 --> 22:19.708
Oh, it's so tasty.

22:19.791 --> 22:22.166
And I don't like
watching people eat it either.

22:25.166 --> 22:27.708
He's dressed like… such a loser.

22:27.791 --> 22:30.833
Keep it down.
She can hear what you're saying.

22:31.375 --> 22:34.333
[Shimura] Been listening to these guys
talking about us the whole time.

22:34.416 --> 22:36.041
I can hardly blame them.

22:36.833 --> 22:38.750
"Why would someone like her..." 

22:41.500 --> 22:42.541
What's wrong?

22:43.791 --> 22:44.666
[groans] Whoa!

22:44.750 --> 22:46.500
-[man 2] Are you okay?
-What's wrong with her?

22:46.583 --> 22:48.083
[Toru] She must really hate chicken.

22:48.166 --> 22:49.625
Ah, jeez

22:52.333 --> 22:53.833
Aki, I'm sorry!

22:53.916 --> 22:56.541
I… didn't realize
you hated chicken that much.

22:56.625 --> 22:57.833
This

22:58.375 --> 22:59.833
is in bad taste.

23:00.333 --> 23:01.416
[whimpers]

23:05.708 --> 23:09.416
[laid-back music playing
softly over speakers]

23:10.125 --> 23:12.416
[indistinct chatter]

23:15.625 --> 23:18.000
I'm sorry… about today.

23:18.625 --> 23:20.416
I shouldn't have dragged you here.

23:20.916 --> 23:21.750
Huh?

23:22.333 --> 23:23.791
Let me get this. [chuckles]

23:24.708 --> 23:25.708
[Shimura sighs]

23:26.791 --> 23:28.458
You've got it all wrong.

23:28.541 --> 23:30.750
I thought that

23:31.250 --> 23:35.541
you were embarrassed
to be seen out with me.

23:37.458 --> 23:40.416
Besides, I… um, well,

23:40.500 --> 23:43.958
I've never hung out
one-on-one with a girl.

23:44.458 --> 23:48.416
And I've never actually…
been to a fancy café.

23:51.000 --> 23:52.125
[gentle music playing]

23:52.208 --> 23:54.875
I, uh, don't really know
what to talk about

23:54.958 --> 23:58.041
or… or what to say to a girl.

23:58.541 --> 23:59.708
And I…

24:01.791 --> 24:03.041
I'm sorry.

24:05.958 --> 24:07.083
Wanna go outside?

24:08.458 --> 24:09.333
Huh?

24:10.500 --> 24:13.375
It's a nice day. Let's talk outside.

24:16.625 --> 24:17.708
Mm.

24:17.791 --> 24:19.166
[cooing]

24:20.791 --> 24:23.750
Oh, really? Yeah, sure.

24:24.583 --> 24:26.125
-Uh, sorry.
-Mm.

24:26.208 --> 24:27.541
That was a friend.

24:28.916 --> 24:31.708
-Ah.
-Actually, he's at the same school as you.

24:31.791 --> 24:32.958
Oh. Who is it?

24:33.041 --> 24:34.625
Ogi Tatsuya. Know him?

24:35.708 --> 24:37.000
Ogi… yeah.

24:37.916 --> 24:38.750
[whispers] Him?

24:41.250 --> 24:43.791
Yes. Of course, I know him.

24:43.875 --> 24:46.750
We're… we're like… besties.

24:46.833 --> 24:48.208
-Ah! Really?
-Yeah.

24:48.291 --> 24:50.375
He says he's just around the corner.

24:50.458 --> 24:51.916
Oh. Is that right?

24:52.000 --> 24:54.375
He wants to say hi.

24:54.458 --> 24:57.500
Uh, no, today is a bit… yeah. Oh yeah.

24:57.583 --> 24:58.791
-I, uh--
-[Ogi] Asamiya!

24:58.875 --> 24:59.750
[Kaho] Ogi!

25:00.250 --> 25:02.541
-So you really were close by.
-[Ogi] Yep.

25:03.208 --> 25:05.125
Ah! You know Shimura.

25:05.208 --> 25:07.208
He said you two were friends.

25:07.291 --> 25:08.416
Friends?

25:09.458 --> 25:10.791
Me and him?

25:17.666 --> 25:18.791
Well, sure we are.

25:19.666 --> 25:21.291
-We're at the same school.
-Huh?

25:22.250 --> 25:24.583
You just started live streaming,
didn't you?

25:24.666 --> 25:27.958
-Oh. Did you?
-Ah. Just a little, yeah.

25:28.041 --> 25:31.000
-[Kota] Ah.
-I like your channel, Viral Hit.

25:31.666 --> 25:33.083
Oh, thank you.

25:33.583 --> 25:37.583
-You know, you're… stronger than you look.
-Huh?

25:37.666 --> 25:40.250
You took the hit
before your opponent could swing.

25:40.333 --> 25:42.041
That way, it's less damage done to you.

25:43.875 --> 25:46.791
-Mm.
-I'm guessing it hurts less that way.

25:47.708 --> 25:48.791
[Shimura] Ogi.

25:49.916 --> 25:52.666
He might know something
about that chicken guy.

25:56.000 --> 25:59.541
Hey, wanna go for a walk?
It's nice over there.

25:59.625 --> 26:00.500
Sure.

26:08.541 --> 26:11.916
There's a rival here now!
This is interesting!

26:12.000 --> 26:14.750
Stay tuned. You don't wanna miss this!

26:14.833 --> 26:16.958
-[Kaho laughing]
-[Ogi] Asamiya, wait up!

26:17.500 --> 26:18.500
[Kaho sighs] Oh.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.125
Remember this?

26:20.208 --> 26:22.166
-[Ogi] Yeah. Course I do.
-[Kaho laughs]

26:22.875 --> 26:25.833
-[Ogi] We took the ferry.
-Yeah, we did.  I'd love to do that again.

26:25.916 --> 26:27.791
-Do you think we could?
-[Ogi] Yeah, sure we can.

26:27.875 --> 26:29.333
[Kaho laughs] Yeah.

26:29.833 --> 26:31.875
[poignant music playing]

26:36.208 --> 26:37.625
Is your gym close by?

26:37.708 --> 26:39.083
Yeah. It's really close.

26:39.166 --> 26:41.000
Ah. I didn't know.

26:41.083 --> 26:42.416
-[Shimura] Question.
-[Ogi] I mean…

26:42.500 --> 26:46.166
[Shimura] Choose the couple that looks
the best together from the options below.

26:46.250 --> 26:49.625
A question so easy,
even grade school kids can solve.

26:50.125 --> 26:51.875
I know the answer myself.

26:52.625 --> 26:53.833
The answer is simple.

26:53.916 --> 26:55.166
[Kaho] Yeah, I'd be interested.

26:55.250 --> 26:56.291
The third wheel…

26:56.375 --> 26:57.250
[Kaho] Really?

26:57.333 --> 26:58.916
-…is me.
-[Ogi] No, you're not.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.458
[Kaho] I am. I mean it.

27:01.333 --> 27:02.208
Uh, sorry.

27:02.291 --> 27:03.875
[poignant music continues]

27:04.666 --> 27:06.708
I'm sorry about this.

27:08.291 --> 27:11.166
My ingrown toenail hurts. I have to leave.

27:11.250 --> 27:12.208
[both] Ingrown toenail?

27:12.291 --> 27:14.791
Uh, yes, my toenail.

27:15.583 --> 27:16.625
See ya.

27:17.250 --> 27:19.250
Uh, hey, Shimura, wait.

27:19.333 --> 27:22.708
[Shimura] If I stay here any longer,
I might die from self-loathing.

27:25.208 --> 27:26.583
[Kaho] You think he's okay?

27:26.666 --> 27:28.250
-[Ogi] He'll be fine.
-[Kaho sighs]

27:35.083 --> 27:37.166
Uh! What's with you? Hey?

27:37.250 --> 27:38.541
Oh! You knew?

27:38.625 --> 27:39.666
You're so obvious!

27:39.750 --> 27:41.041
Oh, when did you catch on?

27:41.125 --> 27:42.458
Since you were at the café.

27:42.541 --> 27:44.416
[groans] Ah, seriously?

27:45.291 --> 27:46.791
I just have to ask…

27:48.083 --> 27:49.250
That you're not streaming now?

27:49.333 --> 27:53.166
Of course not.
Privacy's important, isn't it?

27:54.541 --> 27:55.750
[Shimura grunting]

27:55.833 --> 27:56.916
Hey! Give it back!

27:57.000 --> 27:57.958
BUSTED LOL
HILARIOUS

27:58.041 --> 27:59.125
Give it to me!

28:00.000 --> 28:01.791
Why the hell would you stream it?!

28:01.875 --> 28:04.208
I thought it was a good way
to shake things up.

28:04.291 --> 28:07.541
-This is the worst!
-Yeah, I agree.

28:07.625 --> 28:09.125
Yeah. You are the worst. All right?

28:09.208 --> 28:11.416
Ingrown toenail? That was so lame!

28:11.500 --> 28:13.125
It was all that I could think of.

28:13.208 --> 28:16.500
Not that! I'm saying you ran away
like a scared little chicken!

28:16.583 --> 28:19.750
-What else was I supposed to do?
-[Toru sighs]

28:22.625 --> 28:25.791
Love, it's like a game we play.

28:26.291 --> 28:27.125
Huh?

28:27.208 --> 28:30.416
And a lovely woman is
the prize you get for playing.

28:31.166 --> 28:34.875
If a tough contender comes along,
are you just gonna throw in the towel?

28:35.708 --> 28:38.541
It's okay with me.
If I don't fight, I don't lose.

28:39.708 --> 28:41.833
You coward! You're a loser!

28:41.916 --> 28:44.291
-Listen closely!
-[poignant music playing]

28:44.375 --> 28:48.166
A world-famous basketballer
once said these words,

28:48.250 --> 28:51.166
"When you give up,
that's when the game ends." You get it?

28:52.875 --> 28:56.458
Are you seriously giving up here?

28:56.541 --> 28:59.375
Who was it that got back up
when Hamaken knocked you down?

28:59.458 --> 29:02.416
Who stood up to that other thug
'cause her contact was on your phone?

29:02.500 --> 29:06.000
The buzzer hasn't sounded yet!
The match isn't over!

29:06.083 --> 29:08.333
Go! You've gotta get her back!

29:10.583 --> 29:11.625
Kaneko.

29:13.166 --> 29:14.250
You've…

29:16.916 --> 29:18.208
[yelps] Ah!

29:18.291 --> 29:21.500
Thank you! Thank you!
You've helped me come to my senses!

29:21.583 --> 29:23.875
Stop it! We're friends, aren't we?

29:23.958 --> 29:25.291
[panting]

29:25.375 --> 29:26.375
[sniffles]

29:26.875 --> 29:28.166
I'll do it!

29:30.083 --> 29:32.416
That's right. I'm proud of myself.

29:32.500 --> 29:35.166
A true streamer! [laughs]

29:35.250 --> 29:36.333
Okay, here we go.

29:36.416 --> 29:38.583
"Confessing to a girl
who's out of my league

29:38.666 --> 29:40.791
and then ready to get rejected." Whoo!

29:40.875 --> 29:43.791
[laughing]

29:47.750 --> 29:49.291
Asamiya!

29:50.666 --> 29:51.541
Oh!

29:52.541 --> 29:53.416
[chuckles]

29:55.583 --> 29:58.375
There's still something
I, I wanted to talk to you about.

29:58.458 --> 29:59.958
-Uh, talk?
-Yeah, yeah.

30:01.250 --> 30:04.333
-Where's Ogi?
-He has practice. He went to his gym.

30:04.416 --> 30:06.000
Oh. I see.

30:06.083 --> 30:07.416
[both chuckle]

30:07.500 --> 30:09.291
How's your toenail?

30:09.375 --> 30:11.750
-Oh, yeah, it's fine. All good now.
-[chuckles]

30:11.833 --> 30:14.416
I see. So, what did you want to say?

30:14.500 --> 30:17.791
Oh, yes, well, I… I, um…

30:18.583 --> 30:20.958
I wanted to ask, what is your ideal type?

30:21.541 --> 30:23.583
[laughs] That's a bit out of the blue.

30:23.666 --> 30:27.166
Sorry, I, I wanted to ask you that.

30:27.791 --> 30:30.541
Mm… someone strong, I think.

30:31.125 --> 30:33.875
-Someone strong?
-What about you? What type do you like?

30:33.958 --> 30:35.375
Huh? Oh, me?

30:35.458 --> 30:38.250
Uh, I like, um… I like…

30:38.833 --> 30:41.125
Someone like you, Asamiya.

30:41.625 --> 30:44.416
No. There's no way
I could actually say that.

30:47.291 --> 30:49.750
I just knew you were filming me.

30:49.833 --> 30:51.416
Knock it off, will ya?

30:51.916 --> 30:54.291
Kanegon, what happened to your face?

30:54.958 --> 30:56.000
Run…

30:56.083 --> 30:57.208
-[dull thud]
-[grunts]

30:57.791 --> 30:58.791
[Shimura] Huh.

30:59.250 --> 31:01.541
-[tense music playing]
-Thanks very much, Kanegon.

31:01.625 --> 31:04.958
Luckily, your broadcast saved me
the trouble of finding you.

31:05.666 --> 31:06.791
Sure did.

31:07.416 --> 31:10.166
Didn't I tell you that I'd make you pay?

31:10.250 --> 31:11.708
What do you think you're doing?

31:11.791 --> 31:13.708
-I'm calling the police--
-Asamiya.

31:14.208 --> 31:15.541
You… go on ahead.

31:15.625 --> 31:16.541
[Hamaken] Say what?

31:17.458 --> 31:18.291
Go?

31:19.333 --> 31:22.000
-[Kaho gasps]
-You're not going anywhere.

31:22.083 --> 31:24.041
Let go of me! [whimpers]

31:24.125 --> 31:25.333
[Hamaken] You! Get here!

31:25.416 --> 31:26.333
Asamiya!

31:26.416 --> 31:28.166
-Let me go!
-[Hamaken] Huh?

31:28.250 --> 31:32.125
You acted like you weren't interested
in men when I tried to get your number.

31:32.208 --> 31:34.208
-Huh? You bitch.
-[whimpering]

31:34.291 --> 31:35.708
[Kaho] Stop this!

31:35.791 --> 31:37.291
[Shimura] I must stay calm.

31:37.375 --> 31:39.583
I can't lose my cool before he does.

31:39.666 --> 31:42.500
[TOU-KEI] It's easy to defeat someone
who's lost his cool.

31:42.833 --> 31:46.125
-[Kaho cries] Stop it! Leave me alone!
-I have to restrain myself.

31:46.208 --> 31:47.916
-[Kaho] I said stop!
-Hamaken!

31:48.000 --> 31:48.833
[gasps]

31:51.125 --> 31:53.458
You only fight girls, do you?

31:53.541 --> 31:55.666
[Shimura] That's right. Get him worked up.

31:56.708 --> 31:58.291
-Okay.
-[groans]

31:58.375 --> 31:59.333
Shimura…

32:00.708 --> 32:02.083
Bastard.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.708
You bastard! You're toast!

32:04.791 --> 32:06.875
[Shimura] I can do it. I'll use that move.

32:07.375 --> 32:10.583
-[grunting]
-[Shimura grunts]

32:15.666 --> 32:16.583
What?

32:16.666 --> 32:17.541
[Hamaken] Dumbass.

32:17.625 --> 32:19.958
You think I didn't watch
your video, did you?

32:20.041 --> 32:22.083
You upload everything online.

32:22.166 --> 32:24.416
[Shimura] Ouch. This hurts really bad.

32:24.500 --> 32:25.541
Shimura!

32:27.250 --> 32:30.666
-What should I do? What should I do now?
-[thunder rumbles]

32:30.750 --> 32:31.916
[rain pattering]

32:32.000 --> 32:35.750
My mind, it's gone blank.

32:36.500 --> 32:39.416
[moaning]

32:40.583 --> 32:42.291
[somber music playing]

32:43.041 --> 32:45.000
[Shimura] My house sits in the shadows,

32:46.750 --> 32:49.583
way below the towering skyscrapers.

32:49.666 --> 32:53.708
-The Argentine Backbreaker!
-[students cheering]

32:53.791 --> 32:55.500
[student voices fade]

32:55.583 --> 32:57.708
[Shimura] Perhaps that's the reason…

32:58.625 --> 33:03.375
the reason why…
I've spent my life in the shadows.

33:04.875 --> 33:08.625
But then, this once-in-a-lifetime
opportunity came to me.

33:08.708 --> 33:10.916
[gentle music playing]

33:11.000 --> 33:15.000
I thought I could finally be an ordinary
high school student like everybody else.

33:17.250 --> 33:19.541
But I was a fool to dream
that could happen.

33:20.750 --> 33:22.833
[grunting]

33:22.916 --> 33:26.458
[Shimura] And so now…
I'm paying the price.

33:28.583 --> 33:29.833
And here I am,

33:31.500 --> 33:33.375
back to being a loser again.

33:33.875 --> 33:35.666
[echoing] Shimura!

33:40.666 --> 33:42.708
-I'm home.
-You're home early.

33:42.791 --> 33:44.458
Not out with your friends today?

33:45.416 --> 33:46.708
[Aki] He's got bad taste.

33:46.791 --> 33:47.750
Huh?

33:48.250 --> 33:50.250
[gentle music continues]

33:52.750 --> 33:53.875
THE STREAM HAS ENDED

33:53.958 --> 33:55.583
[Aki] Did he finally stop streaming?

33:57.791 --> 34:02.250
WATCH WHAT HAPPENS NEXT ON HAMAKEN TV

34:08.166 --> 34:11.000
[Kaho] Shimura! Shimura! Please! No more!

34:11.083 --> 34:13.000
[Shimura] I always thought

34:13.083 --> 34:16.166
that it was better to get hit
than to fight back.

34:16.250 --> 34:17.375
[gasping]

34:17.458 --> 34:18.500
Hey!

34:19.208 --> 34:20.666
I'm not finished with you.

34:23.000 --> 34:24.666
[strained] Please, let her go.

34:24.750 --> 34:25.583
What?

34:28.166 --> 34:29.916
Please let her go.

34:33.625 --> 34:37.583
Let Asamiya go home.
Please. Please let her go.

34:37.666 --> 34:39.333
Let me go. Shimura!

34:39.416 --> 34:43.875
[Shimura] I don't want her to see
my pathetic self any longer.

34:44.458 --> 34:47.791
What are you trying to show off for? Huh?

34:47.875 --> 34:49.791
You're nothing but a loser, Shimura!

34:50.375 --> 34:51.500
Shimura!

34:51.583 --> 34:55.875
[Shimura] Asamiya was the one person
who I didn't want to see

34:55.958 --> 34:58.708
just how weak and pathetic I really am.

35:01.458 --> 35:04.416
[rain pouring on live stream]

35:07.458 --> 35:08.583
[shudders]

35:13.500 --> 35:15.500
Please forgive me.

35:17.041 --> 35:18.583
[Hamaken] Shimura.

35:19.666 --> 35:20.791
[groans]

35:20.875 --> 35:21.708
That won't do.

35:22.708 --> 35:24.833
Strip and apologize

35:25.916 --> 35:27.583
to the viewers there.

35:28.416 --> 35:30.416
[somber music playing]

35:31.500 --> 35:34.083
Have you got any idea
how many viewers are tuned in

35:34.166 --> 35:36.208
and looking at this now? Huh?!

35:37.250 --> 35:40.041
[Toru crying] Shimura, I'm sorry.

35:40.125 --> 35:43.333
I said that I didn't want to do this.

35:46.541 --> 35:47.791
NO NEED TO APOLOGIZE

35:47.875 --> 35:48.916
SHIMURA!

35:49.000 --> 35:50.041
PLEASE STOP

35:50.125 --> 35:51.208
[Hamaken laughing]

35:51.291 --> 35:53.000
You're doing great camera work.

35:53.083 --> 35:54.458
He's such a loser.

35:54.541 --> 35:55.875
[Hamaken and boy laughing]

35:56.625 --> 35:57.625
[Toru groans]

35:58.125 --> 36:01.375
You're very good at it.
At the camera work. I'll give you that.

36:01.458 --> 36:02.750
[laughing]

36:02.833 --> 36:04.500
[Shimura sighs deeply]

36:05.666 --> 36:07.875
[Hamaken] Now, hurry up and strip.

36:08.458 --> 36:09.875
If you do, I'll let her go.

36:09.958 --> 36:10.833
[boy] Strip!

36:11.833 --> 36:14.041
[Hamaken laughing]

36:17.666 --> 36:18.750
Hey!

36:20.166 --> 36:21.208
[grunts]

36:21.291 --> 36:22.333
Enough is enough!

36:24.333 --> 36:28.083
[Shimura] The girl I'm in love with…
showed more courage than I did.

36:28.166 --> 36:30.541
-Hey! Don't touch him! Shut up, bitch!
-Let go! Let go!

36:30.625 --> 36:33.791
[Shimura] And all my life,
I've never felt so pathetic.

36:33.875 --> 36:35.208
-[Kaho wails]
-[Shimura] Hamaken!

36:35.291 --> 36:36.208
[Hamaken] Huh?

36:38.500 --> 36:41.583
-[belt jangling]
-[boy laughing]

36:42.583 --> 36:44.208
[Hamaken and boy laughing]

36:45.500 --> 36:47.458
[Shimura] I've failed as a man.

36:48.291 --> 36:50.333
I've stripped. Are you happy?

36:51.000 --> 36:52.958
-[Hamaken laughing] Oh!
-Now let her go.

36:53.041 --> 36:54.791
[both laughing]

36:54.875 --> 36:56.916
[boy] He did it! Stripped it all off!

36:57.000 --> 36:59.000
[both laughing uproariously]

36:59.708 --> 37:01.250
[Hamaken] Get this on camera!

37:01.333 --> 37:03.500
[boy] Keep rolling, man!

37:04.375 --> 37:06.208
[Shimura] This will have to be it.

37:06.291 --> 37:08.958
I don't have the spine to win in a fight.

37:10.041 --> 37:13.208
So this is the only way
I can protect Asamiya.

37:13.291 --> 37:16.125
[Hamaken laughing]

37:16.208 --> 37:17.166
[Shimura] But I'll

37:18.208 --> 37:20.291
at least get in one hit.

37:21.416 --> 37:22.500
This is my…

37:23.083 --> 37:24.500
-Huh?
-[boy] What?

37:24.583 --> 37:25.625
[Toru] Shimura?

37:25.708 --> 37:28.000
Hey. Stop that.

37:28.083 --> 37:29.416
-[boy] Hey!
-[Hamaken] Stop that.

37:29.500 --> 37:31.125
-My last stand.
-[boy] What are you doing?

37:31.208 --> 37:33.333
[Hamaken] Hey! You're gonna get us banned.

37:34.916 --> 37:35.958
Hey!

37:38.125 --> 37:39.625
Hey! Stop!

37:39.708 --> 37:42.000
[Shimura] Goodbye, Asamiya.

37:44.083 --> 37:46.750
[Japanese rock music playing]

37:55.916 --> 38:02.250
VIRAL HIT

38:08.125 --> 38:10.166
[Japanese rock music continues]

39:19.458 --> 39:20.458
[music ends]
